# Web3Forms access key — powers the "Book a Call" form.
#
# Get one (free, ~30s): go to https://web3forms.com, enter the email where
# bookings should be delivered, and they'll email you the key.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (which is git-ignored) and paste your key:
#   VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key-here
#
# The key is public-by-design (it ships in the client bundle); Web3Forms
# protects submissions with a honeypot + allowed-domain checks.
# Until a key is set, the booking form gracefully falls back to a pre-filled
# mailto: so the site is never broken.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
